<section class="card-list tech-seo-important gray-background" id="tech-seo-important">
    <div class="card-list-holder half-half customContainer">
            <article class="card-list-img">
              <img src="/assets/images/services/tech-seo-img/technicalseoimportance.svg" alt="importance of technical SEO">
            </article>
            <article class="card-list-text">
              <h2>Why is SEO Important?</h2>
              <p>While PPC advertising can help you get a spot on the first page of search results much faster, it can be costly. And while, on the other hand, it sometimes takes 6-12 months to feel the benefits of search engine optimization, it is still the best long-term solution for boosting your online presence - no matter the size of your business. Here is why our Chicago digital marketing agency recommends investing efforts in SEO for every company:</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-list-cards">
            <div class="card-list-card">
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>SEO boosts your visibility</strong> - Well-executed SEO strategy increases the visibility of your website, so when potential customers search for specific products or services, they are more likely to find your web pages instead of competitors. More people on your website means more business opportunities.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>SEO boosts trust and credibility</strong> - Having a website that ranks high on Google is a proven way to appear more credible and trustworthy. Optimizing your website for both users and search engines will help you create a positive reputation for your business, exponentially attract new customers and boost sales.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-list-card">
                <p><strong>SEO is cost-effective</strong> - There is a common misconception that SEO is free. While this is not true, we can assure you that search engine optimization is a very cost-effective way to achieve online success for your business. As you will be targeting search engine users who are actively looking to buy a specific product or service, once you manage to rank your pages high in SERPs, you won't need to invest in paid search advertising in order to make sales.</p>
